\operatorname{QFT}_{${1:n}}\lvert ${2:x}\rangle =
\frac{1}{\sqrt{${3:2^n}}}\sum_{${4:y}=0}^{$3-1}
e^{2\pi i $2$4/$3}\lvert $4\rangle$0
